山性）景観 / 非火山性高原","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"10444","municipality_pref":"群馬県","municipality_name":"川場村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"203"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.16976928710938,36.70958709716797]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"高手山","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 火山","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"10444","municipality_pref":"群馬県","municipality_name":"川場村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"102"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.10110473632812,36.76750564575195]}}],"display_comment_original":"川場村周辺には、近世村の記憶として生品村、立岩村、萩室村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、高鳥神社のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では生品村、立岩村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["井上日召","江口きち","桑原鶴","今井今助","土田國太郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["道の駅川場田園プラザ","ホテルSL・ほたか高原駅","川場村中央公園","川場村歴史民俗資料館","日本切り絵百景館","川場スキー場","吉祥寺（花の寺、新上州観音霊場三十三カ所）","武尊神社"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%9D%E5%A0%B4%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3342171","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11550722","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11537489","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11376562","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q56618459","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E4%BA%95%E4%B8%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%8F%AC&keyword=%E5%B7%9D%E5%A0%B4%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"川場村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110194605","wikidata_qid":"Q1345636","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%9D%E5%A0%B4%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E4%BA%95%E4%B8%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%8F%AC&keyword=%E5%B7%9D